1
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:34,960
[OVERDO]

2
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:37,729
[Episode 21]

3
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,150
Say

4
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,030
you want me to leave with you,

5
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:52,009
and we will leave right now.

6
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,640
Shall we?

7
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:07,450
♪ The more passionate ♪

8
00:02:07,470 --> 00:02:09,680
♪ Our past embrace ♪

9
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:14,050
♪ The more icy ♪

10
00:02:14,070 --> 00:02:16,180
♪ Our present clash ♪

11
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,190
Let's go.

12
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:20,340
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

13
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:23,720
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

14
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:29,130
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

15
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:34,000
♪ Sharper pain, deeper mark ♪

16
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:36,260
♪ Deeper care, greater torment ♪

17
00:02:34,630 --> 00:02:35,560
Don't be crazy.

18
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,579
♪ I won't give up on you ♪

19
00:02:40,610 --> 00:02:42,790
♪ Don't let go of me ♪

20
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:47,320
♪ Let the ropes of fate ♪

21
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:50,240
♪ Bind you and me ♪

22
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:53,820
♪ Even if led to a precipice ♪

23
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:56,350
♪ Together, we fall ♪

24
00:02:58,220 --> 00:03:00,050
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

25
00:03:00,070 --> 00:03:02,550
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

26
00:03:02,770 --> 00:03:05,170
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

27
00:03:05,190 --> 00:03:06,730
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

28
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:09,020
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

29
00:03:09,390 --> 00:03:11,670
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

30
00:03:11,690 --> 00:03:14,930
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

31
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:17,880
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

32
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:21,660
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

33
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:24,250
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

34
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,280
♪ We ♪

35
00:03:26,410 --> 00:03:28,480
♪ Must be together ♪

36
00:03:29,090 --> 00:03:32,829
♪ Forevermore ♪

37
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:30,280
Wait.

38
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,329
I just want to say a proper goodbye.

39
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:40,250
After all, I'm going to die,
aren't I?

40
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:48,960
If you die,

41
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,750
he will live on

42
00:03:52,310 --> 00:03:53,710
more easily with hatred,

43
00:03:54,750 --> 00:03:55,400
won't he?

44
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:39,190
[Invitation]

45
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:56,120
Principal,

46
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:58,130
congratulations.

47
00:05:01,190 --> 00:05:01,920
I'm sorry.

48
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:05,970
Why are you saying sorry to me?

49
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:08,750
It's just that

50
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:12,800
I'm afraid
I won't be able to attend your wedding.

51
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,950
I got an opportunity

52
00:05:15,950 --> 00:05:17,560
to study at a foreign aviation school,

53
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,690
and I'll be leaving in a couple of days.

54
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,020
Why didn't you tell me about this?

55
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:27,890
It happened suddenly.

56
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,310
I'm sorry.

57
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,720
If there's nothing else,

58
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,920
I shall take my leave.

59
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:48,200
[Invitation]

60
00:06:14,390 --> 00:06:15,070
Principal,

61
00:06:15,630 --> 00:06:17,160
your wedding with Miss Fang

62
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,800
is just for show.

63
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:20,480
You

64
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,510
could have told Ms. Ye.

65
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,010
Different flight paths

66
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:49,220
lead to different destinations.

67
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,120
Only if I stay here

68
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,240
can she fly high and far.

69
00:06:58,580 --> 00:07:01,710
[Three years ago]

70
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,160
Qingyu, stop drinking.

71
00:07:12,870 --> 00:07:14,360
As the older brother,

72
00:07:15,950 --> 00:07:17,040
I'm so useless.

73
00:07:19,430 --> 00:07:21,190
To save my brother's life,

74
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:25,070
I could only watch

75
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,870
him go to prison with my own eyes.

76
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:34,870
Qingyu.

77
00:07:38,630 --> 00:07:39,430
Qingyu.

78
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,980
Forgive yourself.

79
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:46,060
Responsibility is sometimes a shackle.

80
00:07:46,480 --> 00:07:47,560
It traps you

81
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:51,000
and keeps you from doing what you want.

82
00:07:58,430 --> 00:07:59,190
Zhihong,

83
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,070
the burden I carry...

84
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,000
is just too much.

85
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,950
Qingyu.

86
00:08:36,539 --> 00:08:42,010
[Zhenhua No. 1 Aviation School]

87
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:56,150
[Zhenhua No. 1 Aviation School]

88
00:09:13,390 --> 00:09:14,200
Why?

89
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,670
I've thought it through.

90
00:09:24,080 --> 00:09:25,670
There is no future for us.

91
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,440
You are the eldest young master
of the Murong family,

92
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,840
the famous young marshal
of the Cheng Army,

93
00:09:30,870 --> 00:09:32,730
while I'm just a helpless orphan.

94
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:34,680
But I don't care about that.

95
00:09:35,870 --> 00:09:37,130
Don't misunderstand.

96
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:39,350
I don't mean to belittle myself.

97
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,480
What I care about

98
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,880
isn't the difference in status,

99
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,600
but the difference in responsibilities.

100
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:56,530
You willingly shoulder
too many responsibilities.

101
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,550
Your wife

102
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,840
has to be someone

103
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:01,500
who can share
your family's responsibilities.

104
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:03,330
But that's not what I want.

105
00:10:03,630 --> 00:10:05,360
I don't want to lose my name

106
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:06,480
and my career...

107
00:10:08,750 --> 00:10:09,630
confined for life

108
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:11,440
under the title of Mrs. Murong.

109
00:10:23,030 --> 00:10:23,720
Principal.

110
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,280
In the future,

111
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:33,180
I will still be
your most outstanding pilot.

112
00:10:57,550 --> 00:10:58,840
Why do you think

113
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,160
you'd lose your dreams by being with me?

114
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,120
Why...

115
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,630
won't you even give it a try?

116
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:26,000
Little airplane, come down! Come down!

117
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:33,550
Little kid.

118
00:11:35,510 --> 00:11:36,630
What are you doing?

119
00:11:36,870 --> 00:11:39,360
My airplane landed up there.

120
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:41,840
Miss, can you help me get it?

121
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,960
This wall is too high.

122
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,080
It's dangerous.

123
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,630
How do you know if you don't try?

124
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,080
So,

125
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:40,080
all good things are fleeting.

126
00:12:50,510 --> 00:12:51,440
Qingyu.

127
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,120
You and I are on different paths—

128
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:57,020
we must eventually part ways.

129
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,440
Before I leave,

130
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:04,200
I can only do one last thing for you.

131
00:13:05,750 --> 00:13:06,600
You're here.

132
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,030
If you hadn't come,

133
00:13:09,550 --> 00:13:10,950
I might have really left.

134
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:12,960
Ms. Ye,

135
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:14,750
did you ask to meet me

136
00:13:14,750 --> 00:13:16,480
because there's an emergency?

137
00:13:22,870 --> 00:13:24,240
I know your plan.

138
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,200
I can help you.

139
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:28,910
This time,

140
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,400
I want to give it a try.

141
00:13:37,390 --> 00:13:38,240
Be careful.

142
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:40,480
Hang it straight.

143
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:50,870
Young Master Boze, why are you here?

144
00:13:50,870 --> 00:13:51,470
Mrs. Wang.

145
00:13:51,960 --> 00:13:53,360
Tomorrow is the wedding.

146
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:54,120
I came to see

147
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:55,630
if there's anything I can help with.

148
00:13:55,630 --> 00:13:57,150
You are so thoughtful, Young Master Boze.

149
00:13:57,150 --> 00:13:59,350
These are just chores for the servants.

150
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:00,950
How could we trouble you?

151
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,080
That won't do.

152
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:04,390
Tomorrow is my brother's wedding.

153
00:14:04,390 --> 00:14:05,360
As his younger brother,

154
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:07,560
I should naturally pay more attention.

155
00:14:10,790 --> 00:14:11,440
Qingyi!

156
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,290
Why are you here?

157
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,480
I heard from Qingyu

158
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:16,010
that you were going abroad.

159
00:14:17,230 --> 00:14:18,040
Goodness.

160
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:19,750
You have the nerve to come back?

161
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:21,810
Aren't you afraid of getting beaten?

162
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:24,410
I'm here to deliver a wedding gift.

163
00:15:03,550 --> 00:15:04,950
What are you laughing at?

164
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:09,420
Seeing all these decorations today,

165
00:15:09,510 --> 00:15:11,170
I thought it would be festive.

166
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,520
But why does this meal

167
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:14,480
feel like a meal at a funeral?

168
00:15:15,670 --> 00:15:16,800
You just got beaten.

169
00:15:17,120 --> 00:15:19,380
I see you never learn your lesson, right?

170
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:21,030
It's a joyous day—

171
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:23,960
would it kill you not to talk nonsense?

172
00:15:25,870 --> 00:15:27,030
If you can only say good things

173
00:15:27,030 --> 00:15:28,320
and not bad things,

174
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:30,090
then not many things

175
00:15:30,750 --> 00:15:32,270
can be said in this family.

176
00:15:35,630 --> 00:15:37,690
Didn't you say this wasn't your home?

177
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:40,700
Are you here to make everyone miserable?

178
00:15:41,550 --> 00:15:43,610
Am I the one making people miserable?

179
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,840
Weren't things already miserable?

180
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,870
Everyone is putting on an act.

181
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,480
You did the deeds yourselves.

182
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:54,280
You chose this path yourselves.

183
00:15:54,870 --> 00:15:56,390
Yet you feel miserable inside,

184
00:15:56,390 --> 00:15:58,080
and still try to keep up appearances.

185
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,080
Does it feel good?

186
00:15:59,720 --> 00:16:00,920
Young Master Qingyi,

187
00:16:01,670 --> 00:16:02,530
that's enough.

188
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:08,230
Sister-in-law is truly
a respectable person.

189
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,850
It's just a pity that

190
00:16:10,030 --> 00:16:11,890
the person Qingyu has in his heart

191
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,670
has never been you.

192
00:16:17,390 --> 00:16:18,030
Qingyi,

193
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:19,380
show some respect.

194
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:21,110
Who do you want me to respect?

195
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:22,950
Who deserves my respect?

196
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,270
Qingyi.

197
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:26,480
If you have something to say,

198
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,410
we can talk about it after the meal.

199
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,750
What exactly is your purpose
for coming today?

200
00:16:31,750 --> 00:16:33,120
Do you have to make everyone unhappy

201
00:16:33,120 --> 00:16:34,550
in front of Boze

202
00:16:34,870 --> 00:16:35,840
to be satisfied?

203
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,000
I've already said

204
00:16:40,510 --> 00:16:41,510
I came today

205
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,670
to bring gifts to everyone.

206
00:16:45,870 --> 00:16:46,600
Come in.

207
00:16:54,960 --> 00:16:56,820
Give Madam Murong her gift first.

208
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:01,870
Seeing that your eyesight
is failing recently,

209
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:03,930
I specially got you a pair of glasses.

210
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:09,720
No need.

211
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,920
I can see clearly.

212
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,680
Can you really?

213
00:17:14,750 --> 00:17:16,069
Then can you see clearly

214
00:17:16,069 --> 00:17:17,109
who Qingyu

215
00:17:17,109 --> 00:17:18,109
truly likes?

216
00:17:20,510 --> 00:17:21,640
Can you see clearly

217
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:23,290
what exactly is mixed in

218
00:17:23,829 --> 00:17:25,440
this marriage?

219
00:17:28,830 --> 00:17:29,960
What are you saying?

220
00:17:32,070 --> 00:17:33,720
Mother, you don't need to worry.

221
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:34,640
Men—

222
00:17:35,110 --> 00:17:36,550
even if they fool around outside,

223
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:38,080
they will always come home.

224
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:42,750
Qingyu.

225
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,200
Is what he said true?

226
00:17:47,070 --> 00:17:48,400
Do you have someone else

227
00:17:49,110 --> 00:17:50,270
outside?

228
00:17:56,070 --> 00:17:56,920
Qingyu.

229
00:17:57,790 --> 00:17:59,120
I've told you many times

230
00:17:59,160 --> 00:18:00,590
since you were a child

231
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:03,310
that you are the future
of the Murong family.

232
00:18:03,310 --> 00:18:04,240
Your every move

233
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,240
and action

234
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,970
represents the Murong family.

235
00:18:07,510 --> 00:18:08,750
If you have any

236
00:18:08,750 --> 00:18:10,350
lowly women outside

237
00:18:10,550 --> 00:18:11,750
who make fools of themselves,

238
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:13,350
when someone finds out about it,

239
00:18:13,350 --> 00:18:14,610
embarrassment aside,

240
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:17,260
it would taint the Murong family's name.

241
00:18:19,030 --> 00:18:20,490
Mother, watch your words.

242
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:21,690
Don't worry.

243
00:18:22,510 --> 00:18:23,550
I know who I am

244
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,370
and what I should do.

245
00:18:29,550 --> 00:18:30,240
Qingyu,

246
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:31,640
this is for you.

247
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:34,190
You will definitely like it.

248
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,170
What's this?

249
00:18:39,310 --> 00:18:41,680
Ms. Ye wants to study abroad, right?

250
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,960
I got someone to get her a spot.

251
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:47,080
Since you like the UK so much,

252
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:49,420
you must let the person you love go there.

253
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:50,500
Don't you think so?

254
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:57,270
So it's you who applied for her.

255
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:00,450
I thank you on Ms. Ye's behalf.

256
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:06,680
Both of you are a perfect match.

257
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,720
You both are so broad-minded.

258
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:11,550
I guess—

259
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:14,750
where the sky is high,
the bird can fly anywhere.

260
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:17,240
Even if this bird
flies out of its own world,

261
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:20,360
you have to give it your blessings
in tears.

262
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,570
Isn't that right, Sister-in-law?

263
00:19:28,750 --> 00:19:30,550
This is for you, Sister-in-law.

264
00:19:31,400 --> 00:19:33,680
If one day you have a fight with Qingyu,

265
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:35,660
you can go to this place to cry.

266
00:19:38,270 --> 00:19:39,480
If you don't like it,

267
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,440
you can just burn it.

268
00:19:46,660 --> 00:19:48,610
[Land and Property Ownership Certificate]

269
00:19:48,750 --> 00:19:54,820
[Buyer/Seller] [Currently residing at:]
[Ren Susu]

270
00:19:56,230 --> 00:19:56,650
[Single-family home
at Shangbei, Xiangshuijian]

271
00:20:08,830 --> 00:20:10,830
Thank you, Second Brother-in-law.

272
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,270
Is this a land deed?

273
00:20:16,830 --> 00:20:18,110
Don't worry, sister.

274
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:21,390
I have something for you too.

275
00:20:25,270 --> 00:20:27,470
I heard you wanted to learn how to shoot.

276
00:20:28,480 --> 00:20:29,720
Today, your younger brother

277
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,250
will teach you how to shoot.

278
00:20:32,790 --> 00:20:33,650
Watch closely.

279
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:38,910
♪ Hate is the smoke left by dying flames ♪

280
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:42,450
♪ Love is the warmth
lingering after the wildfire ♪

281
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,310
What are you doing?

282
00:20:42,790 --> 00:20:46,160
♪ Love and hate collide in a blaze ♪

283
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,270
Qingyi.

284
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:50,080
♪ In this instant,
the flames rage out of control ♪

285
00:20:50,180 --> 00:20:53,210
♪ Ahead lies
a tangle of joys and sorrows ♪

286
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,700
This family portrait—

287
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,180
with me, it's too crowded,

288
00:20:53,440 --> 00:20:54,590
but without me, it's just right.

289
00:20:53,570 --> 00:20:56,740
♪ Behind remains
the bitterness of unspoken feelings ♪

290
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,000
Doesn't it

291
00:20:57,070 --> 00:21:00,610
♪ The heart races with every thought ♪

292
00:20:57,550 --> 00:20:59,410
look more pleasing to the eye now?

293
00:21:00,930 --> 00:21:04,650
♪ Yet remains forever bound ♪

294
00:21:04,160 --> 00:21:05,440
I'll skip this meal.

295
00:21:04,670 --> 00:21:07,750
♪ This spark of wildfire
spreading across the plains ♪

296
00:21:06,640 --> 00:21:07,920
I wish you both

297
00:21:08,210 --> 00:21:11,470
♪ Stirs embers that refuse to fade ♪

298
00:21:08,550 --> 00:21:10,240
a long and loving life together

299
00:21:10,240 --> 00:21:11,310
in advance.

300
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:15,230
♪ I seize fate by the hand ♪

301
00:21:15,250 --> 00:21:18,960
♪ Accusing it of refusing to relent ♪

302
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:23,190
♪ Even in the scorching fire ♪

303
00:21:23,820 --> 00:21:26,620
♪ I still hold onto
my unwavering obsession ♪

304
00:21:27,160 --> 00:21:29,900
♪ As long as I can get this love ♪

305
00:21:30,350 --> 00:21:35,350
♪ It doesn't matter
if it's fortune or misfortune ♪

306
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:31,240
Boze,

307
00:21:31,400 --> 00:21:32,000
eat.

308
00:21:47,920 --> 00:21:49,270
A long life...

309
00:22:17,590 --> 00:22:18,520
Is the Huo family

310
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:20,920
gone just like this?

311
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,510
Huo Minxian.

312
00:22:31,790 --> 00:22:32,520
Who's there?

313
00:22:36,790 --> 00:22:38,520
A generation of the Huo family,

314
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,680
blown away by the wind and rain.

315
00:22:41,240 --> 00:22:43,480
Miss Huo, are you really willing
to accept this?

316
00:22:43,480 --> 00:22:44,920
Whether I do or not,

317
00:22:46,240 --> 00:22:47,970
what does it have to do with you?

318
00:22:48,790 --> 00:22:50,160
Fang Mulan and the Murong family

319
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,820
are investigating things
they shouldn't know.

320
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,750
And the Huo family's current situation

321
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:57,400
is also related to them.

322
00:22:58,110 --> 00:23:00,200
So we are on the same boat.

323
00:23:02,920 --> 00:23:04,160
You want to use me.

324
00:23:07,720 --> 00:23:09,830
I don't care that those two bastards

325
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,840
from the Huo family are dead.

326
00:23:12,030 --> 00:23:13,590
The Huo grandfather and grandson

327
00:23:13,590 --> 00:23:15,240
treated you harshly,

328
00:23:15,510 --> 00:23:17,970
so naturally
you have no attachment to them.

329
00:23:18,110 --> 00:23:20,920
But what about your father
who died tragically in Beicheng,

330
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,070
Huo Mingxi?

331
00:23:27,960 --> 00:23:29,160
What do you mean?

332
00:23:31,920 --> 00:23:33,160
This woman

333
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:35,980
is not some Young Miss of the Fang family.

334
00:23:43,030 --> 00:23:44,270
Her story

335
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:46,880
is closely related to your hatred.

336
00:23:46,620 --> 00:23:47,630
[Marriage Notice:
Murong Qingyu & Fang Mulan]

337
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:49,000
Let me

338
00:23:49,750 --> 00:23:51,480
tell you about it in detail.

339
00:23:52,870 --> 00:23:55,880
[The Great World]

340
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,240
Sir,

341
00:24:09,720 --> 00:24:10,640
are you alone?

342
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:12,780
Do you want me to keep you company?

343
00:24:15,310 --> 00:24:16,440
By drinking with me?

344
00:24:16,440 --> 00:24:17,240
Of course.

345
00:24:17,550 --> 00:24:18,110
Scram.

346
00:25:02,350 --> 00:25:03,410
What are you doing?

347
00:25:04,830 --> 00:25:06,030
Drink less.

348
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:08,520
Drinking is bad for your health.

349
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:14,650
Why torture yourself like that

350
00:25:15,070 --> 00:25:16,000
for Miss Fang?

351
00:25:21,110 --> 00:25:22,070
How do you know?

352
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,160
I asked Jinrui.

353
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:29,480
I asked her

354
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:32,000
why you went crazy today.

355
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:34,440
She told me what happened a few days ago.

356
00:25:42,830 --> 00:25:43,550
Indeed.

357
00:25:45,830 --> 00:25:47,890
Miss Fang is gentle and intelligent—

358
00:25:48,270 --> 00:25:49,480
truly captivating.

359
00:25:53,750 --> 00:25:54,790
But Qingyi,

360
00:25:58,240 --> 00:25:59,070
Miss Fang

361
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:02,640
is, after all, your future sister-in-law.

362
00:26:06,750 --> 00:26:08,030
Are you going to hurt Qingyu

363
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,270
just for a woman?

364
00:26:12,270 --> 00:26:13,530
You've made a mistake!

365
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:16,960
I made a mistake?

366
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,370
You're saying I made a mistake?

367
00:26:21,110 --> 00:26:23,310
Why don't you say
Qingyu made a mistake?

368
00:26:24,110 --> 00:26:25,970
Or that Fang Mulan made a mistake?

369
00:26:36,160 --> 00:26:38,820
Qingyu and Miss Fang's relationship
is stable.

370
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,830
You know what kind of person

371
00:26:40,830 --> 00:26:41,880
Qingyu is.

372
00:26:42,510 --> 00:26:45,160
He will definitely protect Miss Fang
all his life.

373
00:26:45,160 --> 00:26:46,560
They are a perfect match.

374
00:26:47,200 --> 00:26:48,960
Why do you have to,

375
00:26:48,960 --> 00:26:50,160
for the secret delusion in your heart,

376
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:52,090
turn the whole family upside down?

377
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:55,270
Delusion?

378
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,540
Do you know what a delusion is?

379
00:27:01,880 --> 00:27:03,310
Let me tell you, Li Boze.

380
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:05,830
Your feelings for Hai Tangqing—

381
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:07,760
do you think others can't see them?

382
00:27:11,400 --> 00:27:12,720
Ask yourself,

383
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:15,280
do you really know Hai Tangqing?

384
00:27:16,270 --> 00:27:17,480
How do you know

385
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:19,530
she won't disappoint you?

386
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,480
Let me tell you, Li Boze.

387
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:30,550
Figure yourself out first

388
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,720
before judging me.

389
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:48,720
You're right.

390
00:27:49,830 --> 00:27:50,590
Qingyi.

391
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,530
Let me tell you this too—

392
00:27:54,830 --> 00:27:56,110
I may not know her,

393
00:27:58,110 --> 00:28:00,510
but that doesn't stop me
from admiring her.

394
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:02,220
Do you understand?

395
00:28:04,440 --> 00:28:05,200
Qingyi,

396
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,210
I'm different from you.

397
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:11,140
If she's interested in me,

398
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:13,640
I will pursue her seriously.

399
00:28:14,160 --> 00:28:15,590
If she isn't,

400
00:28:16,350 --> 00:28:17,720
I won't force her,

401
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:18,310
make things difficult for her,

402
00:28:18,310 --> 00:28:19,240
or hurt her!

403
00:28:23,030 --> 00:28:24,270
I will wait for her.

404
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:54,920
Qingyi.

405
00:28:59,000 --> 00:28:59,960
To be honest,

406
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,250
I don't understand either.

407
00:29:07,830 --> 00:29:08,960
But sometimes,

408
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:11,350
I think of Mother.

409
00:29:13,750 --> 00:29:14,790
Look at her.

410
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:16,430
She loved Father deeply.

411
00:29:17,070 --> 00:29:18,110
A finger bone,

412
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:21,000
or even a little bit of ashes,

413
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:22,270
she carries with her,

414
00:29:23,590 --> 00:29:24,960
missing him madly.

415
00:29:29,440 --> 00:29:30,840
And what about you and me?

416
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,400
The people we love

417
00:29:39,440 --> 00:29:41,590
can live well in this world.

418
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:45,160
It doesn't matter
if we are together or not.

419
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:47,510
I feel like we're much luckier than Mother

420
00:29:48,240 --> 00:29:50,350
being able to see them safe and happy.

421
00:30:20,030 --> 00:30:20,640
Madam,

422
00:30:20,920 --> 00:30:22,440
the lucky bags are ready.

423
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:24,040
Before the bride leaves,

424
00:30:24,200 --> 00:30:25,750
we must ask her brothers

425
00:30:26,030 --> 00:30:27,240
to use these golden scissors

426
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:29,400
to cut a lock of the bride's hair,

427
00:30:29,550 --> 00:30:30,550
and place it in this bag

428
00:30:30,550 --> 00:30:31,790
with Eldest Young Master Murong's hair,

429
00:30:31,790 --> 00:30:33,790
tied together with a red string.

430
00:30:34,160 --> 00:30:35,400
It signifies

431
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,600
a long-lasting union

432
00:30:36,640 --> 00:30:38,100
and growing old together.

433
00:30:38,270 --> 00:30:40,240
Once outside where there is light,

434
00:30:40,350 --> 00:30:42,680
the bride's feet cannot touch the ground.

435
00:30:43,000 --> 00:30:43,530
There...

436
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:48,690
The bride has no maiden family,

437
00:30:48,920 --> 00:30:50,110
let alone a brother.

438
00:30:52,110 --> 00:30:53,240
My father's passing

439
00:30:53,960 --> 00:30:55,020
is known to Mother.

440
00:30:55,550 --> 00:30:57,150
Who arranged this ceremony?

441
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,200
You didn't mention it earlier,

442
00:30:58,200 --> 00:30:59,750
but had to wait
until all the guests arrived

443
00:30:59,750 --> 00:31:01,480
and are already waiting downstairs
to bring it up.

444
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:02,480
This is bullying.

445
00:31:03,510 --> 00:31:04,830
Calm down, miss.

446
00:31:05,030 --> 00:31:07,030
I didn't know the bride's maiden family

447
00:31:07,030 --> 00:31:07,960
was not around anymore.

448
00:31:07,960 --> 00:31:10,200
They're holding this wedding right
after Master Fang's death.

449
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:11,750
I'm afraid they won't find anyone
in all of Nancheng

450
00:31:11,750 --> 00:31:13,030
to carry her out.

451
00:31:13,240 --> 00:31:14,200
Exactly.

452
00:31:14,400 --> 00:31:16,930
Not observing filial piety,
she's so rotten.

453
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:19,650
Who says she doesn't have anyone?

454
00:31:33,590 --> 00:31:34,750
Second Young Master?

455
00:31:34,750 --> 00:31:36,110
He is the groom's brother.

456
00:31:36,110 --> 00:31:37,240
How can he send the bride off?

457
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:38,240
Murong Qingyi?

458
00:31:39,960 --> 00:31:40,890
Why are you here?

459
00:31:41,270 --> 00:31:42,920
Young Master, you shouldn't...

460
00:31:42,920 --> 00:31:44,920
There's no need to be so particular.

461
00:31:45,480 --> 00:31:46,880
If tying a red string

462
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:48,720
could really
make people grow old together,

463
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,720
some people

464
00:31:50,030 --> 00:31:52,760
wouldn't turn pale
at the mention of Yin Jingwan.

465
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:00,450
Compared to the Murong family,

466
00:32:01,110 --> 00:32:03,240
I'm closer to you—

467
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,500
I'm more like your maiden family.

468
00:32:16,680 --> 00:32:17,540
How about this—

469
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:20,720
when the bride is supposed to leave,

470
00:32:20,920 --> 00:32:22,310
I'll carry you out.

471
00:32:45,780 --> 00:32:47,470
♪ The more passionate ♪

472
00:32:46,790 --> 00:32:47,640
I've figured it out.

473
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,690
♪ Our past embrace ♪

474
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:50,050
No matter who you marry,

475
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,210
it doesn't matter to me.

476
00:32:52,470 --> 00:32:54,060
♪ The more icy ♪

477
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:55,000
Even if you are with my eldest brother,

478
00:32:54,080 --> 00:32:56,250
♪ Our present clash ♪

479
00:32:55,440 --> 00:32:57,900
I guess that will keep you
by my side forever.

480
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:58,880
Thinking about it this way,

481
00:32:57,970 --> 00:33:00,300
♪ If not tangled in love ♪

482
00:32:59,790 --> 00:33:01,440
the universally despised Murong family

483
00:33:01,140 --> 00:33:03,710
♪ We are locked in hate ♪

484
00:33:01,920 --> 00:33:03,850
has become much more interesting.

485
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:05,030
By the way,

486
00:33:04,770 --> 00:33:08,750
♪ There is no escaping it ♪

487
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,130
As for the lucky bag,

488
00:33:07,350 --> 00:33:09,010
I replaced the hair with mine.

489
00:33:12,230 --> 00:33:13,700
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

490
00:33:13,720 --> 00:33:15,710
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

491
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:17,590
The bride sets off!

492
00:33:16,420 --> 00:33:18,670
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

493
00:33:18,690 --> 00:33:20,270
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

494
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:22,560
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

495
00:33:23,050 --> 00:33:25,270
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

496
00:33:25,370 --> 00:33:28,500
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

497
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:31,190
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

498
00:33:29,650 --> 00:33:34,240
[Murong Residence]

499
00:33:32,160 --> 00:33:35,240
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

500
00:33:35,300 --> 00:33:37,760
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

501
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:38,840
♪ We ♪

502
00:33:40,070 --> 00:33:42,240
♪ Must be together ♪

503
00:33:42,990 --> 00:33:45,870
♪ Forevermore ♪

504
00:34:02,110 --> 00:34:02,910
Stop pulling.

505
00:34:05,590 --> 00:34:06,720
If you keep pulling,

506
00:34:06,830 --> 00:34:08,360
the clothes will be ruined.

507
00:34:09,280 --> 00:34:10,139
This is for you.

508
00:34:11,639 --> 00:34:13,570
♪ How much love ♪

509
00:34:12,360 --> 00:34:13,960
Inspector Li,
you should keep it for yourself.

510
00:34:13,679 --> 00:34:15,699
♪ Is enough to be wasted? ♪

511
00:34:18,409 --> 00:34:20,139
♪ I haven't forgiven you ♪

512
00:34:19,960 --> 00:34:21,400
What's wrong lately?

513
00:34:20,190 --> 00:34:22,350
♪ So don't you forgive me ♪

514
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:24,960
You've been avoiding me.

515
00:34:24,370 --> 00:34:26,870
♪ Let the wildfire ♪

516
00:34:26,030 --> 00:34:27,000
When you see me,

517
00:34:26,960 --> 00:34:30,050
♪ Consume us and burn us to ashes ♪

518
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,840
it's like you've seen an enemy.

519
00:34:30,150 --> 00:34:31,000
An enemy?

520
00:34:30,900 --> 00:34:33,409
♪ Still, we choose to be moths ♪

521
00:34:32,590 --> 00:34:34,480
That's an interesting choice of word,
Inspector Li.

522
00:34:33,429 --> 00:34:35,940
♪ Flying into the flames ♪

523
00:34:37,070 --> 00:34:38,150
Didn't we agree this is...

524
00:34:38,150 --> 00:34:38,960
Agree on what?

525
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:39,719
♪ Must it take heartache ♪

526
00:34:39,780 --> 00:34:41,820
♪ To know my heart belongs to you? ♪

527
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:42,370
Have I ever promised you anything,
Inspector Li?

528
00:34:42,370 --> 00:34:44,670
♪ Hearts cold no more ♪

529
00:34:44,699 --> 00:34:46,320
♪ Is every sweet dream ♪

530
00:34:46,350 --> 00:34:48,929
♪ Destined to fade away? ♪

531
00:34:49,300 --> 00:34:51,310
♪ Don't let it end in smoke ♪

532
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,580
What exactly is wrong?

533
00:34:51,420 --> 00:34:54,580
♪ Love and hate till the very end ♪

534
00:34:51,710 --> 00:34:52,969
Did something happen?

535
00:34:54,739 --> 00:34:57,250
♪ Hold nothing back ♪

536
00:34:55,110 --> 00:34:56,969
I am used to just putting on an act.

537
00:34:58,070 --> 00:35:00,110
If there was any misunderstanding before,

538
00:34:58,090 --> 00:35:01,220
♪ Never back down, hold my ground ♪

539
00:35:00,590 --> 00:35:01,710
please pay no mind to it.

540
00:35:01,310 --> 00:35:03,870
♪ Till I've given my all ♪

541
00:35:03,030 --> 00:35:04,510
Our statuses are worlds apart.

542
00:35:03,970 --> 00:35:05,020
♪ We ♪

543
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:05,800
After today,

544
00:35:05,940 --> 00:35:08,340
♪ Must be together ♪

545
00:35:07,670 --> 00:35:08,990
we shouldn't meet again.

546
00:35:08,990 --> 00:35:11,370
♪ Forevermore ♪

547
00:35:12,070 --> 00:35:13,190
I wish Inspector Li

548
00:35:13,630 --> 00:35:14,800
a bright future.

549
00:35:29,070 --> 00:35:31,030
If I didn't do something well enough

550
00:35:31,030 --> 00:35:32,360
for you to like me,

551
00:35:31,240 --> 00:35:32,660
♪ Take away everything I have ♪

552
00:35:32,700 --> 00:35:34,720
♪ Can you bear the weight of it all? ♪

553
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,890
then I respect your choice.

554
00:35:35,640 --> 00:35:37,650
♪ I offer you my whole life ♪

555
00:35:36,110 --> 00:35:37,030
But you can't deprive me of

556
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:38,360
my right to like you.

557
00:35:37,670 --> 00:35:39,330
♪ In exchange for my everything ♪

558
00:35:39,000 --> 00:35:40,440
As long as there is no one else you fancy,

559
00:35:39,350 --> 00:35:41,270
♪ Will you finally be mine? ♪

560
00:35:41,840 --> 00:35:43,110
I will always like you

561
00:35:41,920 --> 00:35:44,270
♪ Give me love and hate ♪

562
00:35:43,590 --> 00:35:44,330
and wait for you.

563
00:35:44,330 --> 00:35:45,870
♪ Let the tears fall ♪

564
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,820
♪ Let the blood spill ♪

565
00:35:47,940 --> 00:35:50,300
♪ Even through suffering,
I'll never let go of your hand ♪

566
00:35:51,150 --> 00:35:54,280
♪ I can't break free, I can't escape ♪

567
00:35:54,310 --> 00:35:56,790
♪ This, too, can be called
a lifetime together ♪

568
00:35:56,110 --> 00:35:57,110
It won't take long

569
00:35:56,870 --> 00:35:58,090
♪ We ♪

570
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:01,120
♪ Remain bound by fate until the end ♪

571
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:00,030
for your feelings for me

572
00:36:01,940 --> 00:36:06,390
♪ Forevermore ♪

573
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:03,880
to vanish into thin air.

574
00:36:18,700 --> 00:36:21,210
♪ Neither you nor I ♪

575
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:22,400
The wedding car is here.

576
00:36:22,400 --> 00:36:22,920
Let's go have a look.

577
00:36:22,920 --> 00:36:23,760
The bride and groom
are entering the venue.

578
00:36:23,410 --> 00:36:25,480
♪ Can ever break free ♪

579
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:24,440
Let's go.

580
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,970
You can leave first.

581
00:36:34,150 --> 00:36:35,750
I'll handle the rest myself.

582
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:43,550
How is it?

583
00:36:44,110 --> 00:36:44,960
Are you ready?

584
00:36:54,000 --> 00:36:55,400
When the ceremony begins

585
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,880
and everyone is seated,

586
00:36:57,400 --> 00:36:58,930
I'll be on the second floor,

587
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:01,480
waiting for the right moment
to assassinate Li Rongzhang.

588
00:37:01,480 --> 00:37:02,920
Whether I succeed or not,

589
00:37:03,190 --> 00:37:05,030
you must distance yourself from me

590
00:37:05,030 --> 00:37:07,090
and pretend to know nothing about it.

591
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:09,040
During the ceremony,

592
00:37:09,320 --> 00:37:10,650
I will go on stage first.

593
00:37:14,960 --> 00:37:15,710
Come out.

594
00:37:30,590 --> 00:37:31,400
Zhihong?

595
00:37:35,840 --> 00:37:36,670
Qingyu.

596
00:37:37,510 --> 00:37:38,840
I know about your plan.

597
00:37:39,800 --> 00:37:41,130
I'm willing to help you.

598
00:37:50,840 --> 00:37:52,880
You're saying you would marry in my place?

599
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:53,590
I know

600
00:37:53,920 --> 00:37:54,510
that at the wedding,

601
00:37:54,510 --> 00:37:56,770
you have something very important to do.

602
00:37:57,590 --> 00:37:58,920
I can help cover for you.

603
00:38:01,510 --> 00:38:03,000
This matter is very dangerous.

604
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:04,150
Don't get involved.

605
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:07,410
The wedding is the key to your success.

606
00:38:08,150 --> 00:38:10,030
As long as there is a bride wearing a veil

607
00:38:10,030 --> 00:38:11,960
to complete the ceremony with him,

608
00:38:11,960 --> 00:38:14,000
no matter if
your operation succeeds or not,

609
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:14,800
he will have an excuse

610
00:38:14,800 --> 00:38:16,260
to insist he knew nothing.

611
00:38:23,960 --> 00:38:25,150
Then if I'm exposed,

612
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:28,850
you will naturally be exposed too.

613
00:38:29,280 --> 00:38:30,480
What will you do then?

614
00:38:33,280 --> 00:38:34,190
In that case,

615
00:38:34,590 --> 00:38:36,790
it'd be my one-sided crush on Principal

616
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:38,320
that made me lose my mind,

617
00:38:38,800 --> 00:38:42,060
leading me to deceive him
and become the substitute bride.

618
00:38:44,880 --> 00:38:45,760
No matter what,

619
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:47,670
he must not be involved.

620
00:38:58,440 --> 00:38:59,960
Let this fake wedding

621
00:39:01,320 --> 00:39:02,880
have a pair of true lovers.

622
00:39:16,230 --> 00:39:17,890
No matter what happens later,

623
00:39:20,030 --> 00:39:21,360
don't take off the veil.

624
00:39:22,550 --> 00:39:23,400
The bride

625
00:39:24,280 --> 00:39:25,510
must be Miss Fang.

626
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:28,200
Rest assured.

627
00:39:28,320 --> 00:39:29,030
I know.

628
00:39:44,070 --> 00:39:45,070
Go prepare first.

629
00:39:51,030 --> 00:39:52,800
It's not too late for you to back out now.

630
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:53,730
I won't back out.

631
00:40:02,030 --> 00:40:02,800
Sorry.

632
00:40:07,480 --> 00:40:09,810
You're doing this
to help me too after all,

633
00:40:10,510 --> 00:40:11,230
right?

634
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,900
You should go prepare too.

635
00:40:30,630 --> 00:40:31,360
Qingyi,

636
00:40:33,190 --> 00:40:34,000
this time,

637
00:40:36,880 --> 00:40:38,070
don't wait for me.
